ex:morphing a ex:Mechanism ;
    rdfs:label "morphing" ;
    ex:hasEvidence "Cant angle morphing winglets investigation for the enhance‐",
        "Keywords：morphing aircraft；",
        "Morphing process of the Monoplane-Biplane morphing aircraft.",
        "design for morphing aircraft: Review",
        "dynamic aerodynamic calculation methods and aerodynamic optimization design technologies for morphing aircraft. Fi⁃",
        "for morphing aircraft. Firstly， the development of morphing aircraft can be divided into two stages by the progression of",
        "implementation of morphing aircraft are analyzed， with particular focus on the research progress and current status of",
        "morphing aircraft［J］. Acta Aeronautica et Astronautica",
        "morphing wing；",
        "prospect of morphing aircraft［J］. Aircraft Design， 2022，",
        "summarizes morphing solutions for different parts of the aircraft， namely， the head deformation， wing deformation，" ;
    ex:has_component ex:aircraft,
        ex:wing ;
    ex:is_a ex:aircraft,
        ex:wing .

